From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 02:19:35 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] arm(dispatch): gouraud dispatch + branchless sort

Measured, moving camera, 900 frames, best-of-4:

  job 0824-234549-mg2010 [MERGED-gouraudsort]
  ctl 64.38 ms   d_both 63.87 ms   -0.50 ms  -0.78%   2.5 sigma  PROBABLE

Rungs: disp -0.62%, sortbl -0.65%, sum -1.27% vs measured both -0.78%.
Sub-additive, consistent with the two touching the same path.

2.5 sigma is probable, not confirmed. Needs a re-run before banking.
Touches gouraud_tri_i686.S, which hunt/w7 also edits -- CONFLICTS with the
prologue arm.

NOT YET adversarially verified.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
